---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & DPDP notice"
  description="How AK Realtors collects, uses, and shares enquiry data, and how to reach our grievance officer under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act."
>
  <main class="container privacy-page">
    <h1>Privacy &amp; DPDP notice</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: DATA SLOT — set this to the date this notice is actually published.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit an enquiry (site visit form, WhatsApp, or phone call) we collect your name, phone number, the
      project and configuration you asked about, and your preferred site-visit timing. Analytics tools (see below)
      also collect anonymous browsing data once you consent to cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>
      Your enquiry is used to contact you about the project you asked about, and — only if you separately opt in —
      to send you other AK Realtors project updates. Your name and number are shared with the developer of the
      project you enquire about, so they can also assist with your enquiry.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics (GA4), Google Ads conversion tracking, and the Meta Pixel to understand which pages
      and campaigns lead to genuine enquiries. These only run after you accept the cookie banner; you can change
      your choice at any time by clearing your browser's local storage for this site.
    </p>

    <h2 id="grievance">Grievance redressal</h2>
    <p>
      Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you may contact our Grievance Officer with any question
      or complaint about how your data is handled:
    </p>
    <p>
      {SITE.grievanceOfficer}<br />
      {SITE.grievanceEmail}<br />
      +91 {SITE.consultants[0].displayPhone}<br />
      We respond within 90 days.
    </p>

    <h2>MahaRERA</h2>
    <p>
      AK Realtors Pvt. Ltd. is a MahaRERA-registered channel partner, agent number {SITE.reraAgentNumber}. Verify our
      registration and every project's RERA number at <a href={SITE.reraUrl}>maharera.maharashtra.gov.in</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    padding: 56px 24px 96px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 26px;
    margin: 40px 0 10px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
